  "notes": "This list is editable. run.py fetches each source, then runs a general web search pass to catch relevant items missed by the fixed sources above. Items older than lookback_days are deprioritized. Diversity matters as much as recency: pull broadly across FMCG, fashion, jewellery, F&B, e-commerce, BFSI and D2C brand campaigns/launches/stunts, not just agency 'mandate win' listicle pages — those under-represent the range of client categories worth tracking. Sources tagged section=experiential feed the Experiential Economy section (bucket6); run the experiential_search_queries too, since many of the best items (tours, races, box office) surface via search rather than trade-press home pages.",
  "experiential_search_queries": [
    "India concert tour announced <month year> tickets presale sponsor",
    "stand-up comedy India tour stadium <month year> District OR BookMyShow",
    "HYROX India <city> <month year>",
    "marathon OR half marathon India <month year> title sponsor OR elite field",
    "Ironman OR triathlon OR cyclothon India <month year>",
    "box office opening weekend <month year> Hindi OR Telugu OR Tamil",
    "trailer launch event OR fan screening <month year> India",
    "music festival India lineup announced <month year> (Lollapalooza, NH7 Weekender, Sunburn, Zomaland, Echoes of Earth, Magnetic Fields)",
    "brand pop-up OR immersive experience OR brand IP event India <month year>",
    "BookMyShow OR District OR thumpN OR Paytm Insider <month year> live events",
    "live events policy OR venue OR stadium concert India <month year>",
    "global: Live Nation OR AEG OR Sphere OR stadium tour gross <month year>"
  ]
